runtime_output_rule|reference|exactly-/output/reference/comparison-evidence.bin,regular,no-symlink,no-hardlink,owner-65532:65532,mode-0600,bounded,no-other-entry
runtime_output_rule|launch|bounded-allowlist-from-acceptance-plan,regular,no-symlink,no-hardlink,owner-65532:65532,no-device,no-socket,no-fifo,no-other-entry
runtime_environment_rule|all|empty-baseline,exact-reviewed-name-allowlist,no-secret,no-credential,no-host-environment-inheritance
runtime_authority_rule|all|read-only-root,uid-65532,gid-65532,no-network,no-capabilities,no-new-privileges,no-device,no-host-pid,no-host-ipc,no-host-uts,no-privileged,no-extra-mount-or-output
runtime_handoff_rule=controller-opens-bounded-regular-output-no-follow,checks-owner-mode-link-count-size-and-hash,copies-to-fresh-controller-owned-file,rechecks-same-descriptor,unmounts-prior-role-before-next-role
identity_rule|image-digests|build,reference,launch-pairwise-distinct
identity_rule|inventory-digests|match-exact-image-contents
identity_rule|comparison-schema|match-trusted-controller-copy
blocked_rule|all-activating-identities|unavailable
ready_rule|all-identities|lowercase-sha256-or-digest-pinned
ready_rule|candidate-images|two-independent-byte-identical-exports
ready_rule|review|correctness+security
